==================================================
RUNTIME ERRORS (3)
==================================================

ERROR 1: Invalid or unexpected token
  Type: PageError (JavaScript parse/syntax error)
  Context: Occurs during WASM initialization
  Severity: MEDIUM - May be related to EM_ASM blocks or generated JS
  Analysis: Likely a syntax issue in emscripten_run_script() call or
            EM_ASM block output. Could be from web_rom_loader.c or
            web_storage.c EM_ASM blocks. Needs investigation to find
            the exact source location.

ERROR 2: 2 FS.syncfs operations in flight at once
  Type: Emscripten warning (logged as error in console)
  Context: IDBFS synchronization
  Severity: LOW - This is a benign warning from Emscripten.
  Analysis: web_storage_init() calls FS.syncfs(true, ...) and the game
            engine may also trigger a sync before the first one finishes.
            This is harmless but indicates a minor race condition in
            initialization ordering. Could be fixed by adding a sync
            completion check before the second sync call.

ERROR 3: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'getContextSafariWebGL2Fixed')
  Type: PageError (JavaScript runtime error)
  Context: SDL2 / Emscripten WebGL initialization
  Severity: HIGH for headless, LOW for real browser
  Analysis: This is an Emscripten SDL2 port issue specific to headless
            Chromium environments. The Emscripten GL library references
            a Safari-specific WebGL2 fix helper that doesn't exist in
            the headless context. In a real browser with GPU support,
            this code path should work correctly as WebGL will be
            properly initialized.

